"```admonish warning\n"
"Make sure to assign the `ScopeFilter` as a `val`! This is an\n"
"implementation detail requirement of the `.all` macro.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish warning\n"
"`ScopeFilter` は必ず `val` として代入すること！これは `.all` マクロの\n"
