#: src/reference/reference/task.md:488
msgid ""
"The `all` method is implicitly added to tasks and settings. It accepts a "
"`ScopeFilter` that will select the `Scopes`. The result has type `Seq[A]`, "
"where `A` is the key's underlying type."
msgstr ""
"`all` メソッドはタスクとセッティングに暗黙的に追加される。"
"`Scopes` を選択する `ScopeFilter` を受け取る。"
"結果の型は `Seq[A]` で、`A` はキーの基底型だ。"

